{
 "about": "Declared re-baselines over carry_head.npz (captured at 5d04c296, which stays the head capture). Each event records, per moved key, the head value, the new value and their ULP distance, with its cause and the three criteria of vv-principles 'Bit-identity vs principled-equivalence'. Read through _carry_cases.expected; gated by test_wave2_carry.py::test_the_rebaselines_are_declared_deltas.",
