    "drift_explained": "0 of 18 fixed-source fluxes moved (17 bodies and the slab inflow: the fixed-source solve evaluates no k-quotient); 36 of 46 k-path entries moved, each by at most 18 ULP; the leakage bridge only types its carrier (a ScalarFlux on the bulk space), and the route gate tests/gates/cross_method/test_production_pairs_typed_members.py shows every exact membership call of an SN solve receives a typed member"
   },
